---
import Verticalgrid from "../assets/Verticalgrid.astro";
---

<section class="relative">
  <Verticalgrid />
  <div
    class="max-w-7xl px-8 md:px-12 lg:px-32 mx-auto py-12 lg:py-24 relative space-y-24">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 mt-6 list-none lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-24">
      <div>
        <h2 class="mt-8 text-white text-2xl xl:text-3xl 2xl:text-5xl font-normal tracking-tight text-white">
          Full Stack Digital Wallet for your Store
        </h2>
        <p class=" text-xl xl:text-xl mt-4 text-vulcan-300 ">
            Complete stack of features to implement all types of acquisition and retention programs. Reward, incentive, cashback, coupon or store credit programs all rolled into one.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:mt-0 mt-12 h-full">
        <img
          alt="Lexington thumbnail"
          loading="lazy"
          class="rounded-2xl shadow-2xl shadow-vulcan-950/50 w-full"
          src="/assets/card2.svg"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 mt-16 -mx-4 gap-y-10 sm:mx-auto lg:max-w-none md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-x-4">
      <div class="flex flex-col rounded-3xl p-[0.060rem] shadow-2xl shadow-vulcan-950 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-800 via-indigo-500/5">
        <div class="h-full p-6 bg-vulcan-900 rounded-3xl">
          <div>
          <div class="text-indigo-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="w-6 h-6"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 8.25V18a2.25 2.25 0 002.25 2.25h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0021 18V8.25m-18 0V6a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 6v2.25m-18 0h18M5.25 6h.008v.008H5.25V6zM7.5 6h.008v.008H7.5V6zm2.25 0h.008v.008H9.75V6z"></path></svg></div>
            <h3 class="mt-5 text-xl text-white">
              Gift cards
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-base text-vulcan-300">Allow users to add and redeem gift cards using the Google Wallet app, and send them a reminder whenever they’re nearby a physical store.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-8">
            <a class="flex items-center justify-center h-10 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition-all border rounded-lg bg-vulcan-900 hover:text-indigo-400 border-vulcan-700" aria-label="Big fish tier" href="/register">Get started</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col rounded-3xl p-[0.060rem] shadow-2xl shadow-vulcan-950 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-800 via-indigo-500/5">
        <div class="h-full p-6 bg-vulcan-900 rounded-3xl">
          <div>
          <div class="text-indigo-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="w-6 h-6"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 8.25V18a2.25 2.25 0 002.25 2.25h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0021 18V8.25m-18 0V6a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 6v2.25m-18 0h18M5.25 6h.008v.008H5.25V6zM7.5 6h.008v.008H7.5V6zm2.25 0h.008v.008H9.75V6z"></path></svg></div>
            <h3 class="mt-5 text-xl text-white">
              Loyalty cards
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-base text-vulcan-300">Create digital loyalty cards your customers can add to Google Wallet for convenient access to rewards and purchase history. </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-8">
            <a class="flex items-center justify-center h-10 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition-all border rounded-lg bg-vulcan-900 hover:text-indigo-400 border-vulcan-700" aria-label="Big fish tier" href="/register">Get started</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col rounded-3xl p-[0.060rem] shadow-2xl shadow-vulcan-950 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-800 via-indigo-500/5">
        <div class="h-full p-6 bg-vulcan-900 rounded-3xl">
          <div>
          <div class="text-indigo-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="w-6 h-6"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 8.25V18a2.25 2.25 0 002.25 2.25h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0021 18V8.25m-18 0V6a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 6v2.25m-18 0h18M5.25 6h.008v.008H5.25V6zM7.5 6h.008v.008H7.5V6zm2.25 0h.008v.008H9.75V6z"></path></svg></div>
            <h3 class="mt-5 text-xl text-white">
              In-store payments
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-base text-vulcan-300"> Give your customers a fast, simple way to pay in millions of places – online, in stores, and more. Bring together everything they need at checkout for a frictionless payment experience.
</p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-8">
            <a class="flex items-center justify-center h-10 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition-all border rounded-lg bg-vulcan-900 hover:text-indigo-400 border-vulcan-700" aria-label="Big fish tier" href="/register">Get started</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col rounded-3xl p-[0.060rem] shadow-2xl shadow-vulcan-950 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-800 via-indigo-500/5">
        <div class="h-full p-6 bg-vulcan-900 rounded-3xl">
          <div>
          <div class="text-indigo-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="w-6 h-6"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 8.25V18a2.25 2.25 0 002.25 2.25h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0021 18V8.25m-18 0V6a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 6v2.25m-18 0h18M5.25 6h.008v.008H5.25V6zM7.5 6h.008v.008H7.5V6zm2.25 0h.008v.008H9.75V6z"></path></svg></div>
            <h3 class="mt-5 text-xl text-white">
              offers
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-base text-vulcan-300">Enable users to add offers from your webpage or app directly to Google Wallet. Implement enhanced features, like offer expiration notification and geofenced notifications to drive engagement with users. </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-8">
            <a class="flex items-center justify-center h-10 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition-all border rounded-lg bg-vulcan-900 hover:text-indigo-400 border-vulcan-700" aria-label="Big fish tier" href="/register">Get started</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
